      ],
      "image": "assets/images/132358/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt butter in a large skillet over medium heat. Stir in garlic and cook for a few seconds until fragrant.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/iqP3Z7BfuL_F7jTm8O9kzedMo5M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/132358-easy-garlic-lemon-scallops-DDMFS-step-02-e0c955d371d445c294650174686240e8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/132358/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Arrange scallops in a single layer in the skillet; cook until golden brown on one side, about 2 minutes. Turn scallops over using tongs and continue cooking until firm and opaque, about 2 minutes more.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/SWAPhgYEa4Mknm75J0_HbrPDqGc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/132358-easy-garlic-lemon-scallops-DDMFS-step-03-7633e230e2b846b5808a9cb62b33d114.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/132358/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer scallops to a platter, reserving butter in the skillet.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/UEjMbHy-wSgKgS00RcXeqKeYC4A=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/132358-easy-garlic-lemon-scallops-DDMFS-step-04-ad348765f3dd4210a9a1280d0f92d865.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/132358/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk lemon juice, salt, and pepper into butter; pour sauce over scallops to serve.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
